%% Tenant overrides and plan limit overrides
%% Status: current | Related: apps/api/src/lib/limit-resolution.js, feature-flags.js
flowchart LR
  subgraph Limits
    PlanDef[plan.limits default] --> PlanOv[plan_limit_override\nincrease-only]
    PlanOv --> TenantOv[tenant_limit_override\nincrease-only + expiry]
    TenantOv --> Addon[subscription add-ons\nbranches / warehouses qty]
    Addon --> EffectiveLimit[effective limit for enforcement]
  end

  subgraph Features
    PlanFeat[plan.features] --> GlobOv[feature_flag global override]
    GlobOv --> TenFeat[feature_flag_override per tenant]
    TenFeat --> Eval[evaluatePlanFeatureValue]
  end

  Admin[Admin override-limit POST] --> TenantOv
  AdminPlan[Admin plan-overrides PATCH] --> PlanOv
